EmailTemplate.textOnly:
This is a notification that a committed AGP Sales opportunity has just been assigned a Business Consultant.

The Opportunity might not yet be Closed Won, so please confirm the current phase of the customer's journey before taking action.

Please work with the other EverQuoters named below to help this customer kick off a successful AGP experience!

Account: {!Account.Name}, https://na90.salesforce.com/{!Account.Id}
Opportunity: {!Opportunity.Name}, https://na90.salesforce.com/{!Opportunity.Id}

Sales Owner: {!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}
Business Consultant: {!Opportunity.Business_Consultant__c}
Current CSM (if applicable): {!Account.Support_Rep__c}

Best, 
Your Friendly Neighborhood SalesForce Admin

P.s. If you think you are receiving this in error, please contact your SDFC admin to report the bug. Thanks!
